          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 60,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "God, you have rejected us. You have broken us down. You have been angry. Restore us, again.",
      "ko": "하나님이여 주께서 우리를 버려 흩으셨고 분노하셨사오나 지금은 우리를 회복시키소서",
      "source_text_hash": "3ae021c7991fccdc228297a8016460b590a290dee68e6b40c0cd6ee795599fa8",
      "translation_text_hash": "8325bee3bc157f7aabae540cba7695e4416c7e8354372f039f9b1089b3c81664",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님이여 주께서 우리를 버려 흩으셨고 분노하셨사오나 지금은 우리를 회복시키소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8325bee3bc157f7aabae540cba7695e4416c7e8354372f039f9b1089b3c81664"
      ]
    },
