      "en": "You have made the land tremble. You have torn it. Mend its fractures, for it quakes.",
      "ko": "주께서 땅을 진동시키사 갈라지게 하셨사오니 그 틈을 기우소서 땅이 요동함이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "4ae00e1491efb980c1f2ee60f4aee58522bbf9fe535bbe0f5edbc6507b3d3532",
      "translation_text_hash": "696f17fd9a953e1ed4e22ead36f1b3f7ac6779c59971169d549530ccacd72ce2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
