      "en": "Gilead is mine, and Manasseh is mine. Ephraim also is the defense of my head. Judah is my scepter.",
      "ko": "길르앗이 내 것이요 므낫세도 내 것이며 에브라임은 내 머리의 보호자요 유다는 나의 홀이며",
      "source_text_hash": "b802861f1ea288c060bb8fd14ad08a280a0c30e499e15a8bb92119a442a5ed13",
      "translation_text_hash": "085bc2a9468f46b3ce1b89ed3b5d1c0bca651827d9f688e15840bb0c13531d4d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
